result.summary:
I added `scripts/gen-design-md.mjs`, which exports a synchronous `buildDesignMd()`. It reads `sondalab.tokens.json`, `packages/ui-kit/neutrals.json` (the default product's baked light and dark neutrals), `agent/accent-registry.json` (following `inherits`), `docs/design-language.md` and `agent/flavour.md`, and returns the full DESIGN.md text without writing anything. It writes the file only when run directly, which it detects by comparing the realpath of argv[1] with its own module URL. Values that come from the sources at build time:
- the colour roles for light, dark and high contrast, plus the default accent;
- every product's accent, with depth, fill and inherits notes;
- the font roles and the text, line, space, radius and motion scales;
- the control height, taken from the "are all **Npx**" sentence;
- the four effect meanings, taken from "X means *...*";
- the 12 traits, the bezel-card bullets and the do-not-converge rows.

Rules and their one-line reasons are fixed prose in the generator. For the do-not rows, it strips the "Owner decision/ruling, date:" prefix and states the current rule. "Figurative art" gets its reason from the wordmark rule (the brand is typographic, with no pictorial mark), not from the L3 Art text. The generator throws, and writes nothing, in these cases:
- a source path or table is missing, including no control height, no motion tokens or no do-not table;
- a colour role, radius, font role or motion token has no written use, or a written use no longer has a source value;
- the output contains a date, the word "owner", an amendment note or since/until-version history.

Other changes:
- I wrote the committed `packages/ui-kit/agent/DESIGN.md` with its nine `##` sections in the required order.
- `package.json` has a `gen:design-md` script (`node scripts/gen-design-md.mjs`), and `gen:tokens` now runs the generator last.
- I added a DESIGN.md row to the file table in `packages/ui-kit/agent/README.md`.
- `packages/ui-kit/package.json` already ships `agent/`, so it is unchanged.
- No CSS, token, source-document or test file was touched.

